{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Try to survive with your friends in Giant Valley</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this story-driven co-op survival RPG, you and your friends are sent to an island full of dinosaurs as special investigators for the Sentinel Agency to solve three murders in an amusement park. During your investigation, it quickly becomes clear that your goal has changed\u2014 you must survive</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951380/extras/69e720953ccf10e9a562d47948e1c8de.poster.avif?t=1756742991\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951380/extras/69e720953ccf10e9a562d47948e1c8de.webm?t=1756742991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951380/extras/69e720953ccf10e9a562d47948e1c8de.mp4?t=1756742991\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Face the challenge</strong></u> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have to do everything in your power to leave the island in one piece. Find out what is really going on in Giant Valley and uncover the secrets of the island. And if a dinosaur spots you, you should run away... Or pull out a powerful weapon and shoot!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Get ready for an exciting combat experience</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your friends have various options for surviving dangerous situations: Sneak cautiously through deadly scenarios or shoot your way through with brute force against ancient hunters who are much stronger and faster than humans. The skill tree and various weapons, armor, and consumables give you the opportunity to play the game the way you want. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951380/extras/07f4e39913c256cb41b5f7b53fb2bac7.poster.avif?t=1756742991\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951380/extras/07f4e39913c256cb41b5f7b53fb2bac7.webm?t=1756742991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951380/extras/07f4e39913c256cb41b5f7b53fb2bac7.mp4?t=1756742991\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Hardcore survival mechanics</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must eat, drink, and rest in the safe rooms to save your respawn point. When you die, you return to your last respawn point without your equipment. But don't worry, you can get your stuff back. A look at an already explored area opens up new possibilities. The weapons and equipment you find will change again and again. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Follow the clues</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve key puzzles together to access new hidden sections. Discover the first crime scenes that brought you to the island. No two playthroughs will be the same, as the game world changes constantly in certain places. Find legendary equipment through clues to be better prepared against both human and prehistoric enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951380/extras/379b9227c1dd2cd48a4a7b708e10f29c.poster.avif?t=1756742991\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951380/extras/379b9227c1dd2cd48a4a7b708e10f29c.webm?t=1756742991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951380/extras/379b9227c1dd2cd48a4a7b708e10f29c.mp4?t=1756742991\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Save those who can be saved</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There will be some survivors who need your help. They will show their gratitude with information and clues, as well as important equipment items. However, each character has their own secrets and motivations for pursuing their own goals, so be on your guard!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2951380?t=1756742991","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2951380?t=1756742991","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951380/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756742991","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951380/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756742991","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"People are shot, mutilated, eaten and tortured. \r\nIllegal use of drugs.\r\nSexualized violence in text form only. "},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Try to survive with your friends in Giant Valley</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this story-driven co-op survival RPG, you and your friends are sent to an island full of dinosaurs as special investigators for the Sentinel Agency to solve three murders in an amusement park. During your investigation, it quickly becomes clear that your goal has changed\u2014 you must survive</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autopla